From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lethalbas <lethalbas@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:03:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] build(win): include winres.h instead of MFC afxres.h in game
 .rc files

SeriousSam.rc and DedicatedServer.rc include afxres.h, which ships
only with the MFC component (not installed on the reference PC).
winres.h from the Windows SDK provides the same resource definitions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 SamTFE/Sources/DedicatedServer/DedicatedServer.rc | 2 +-
 SamTFE/Sources/SeriousSam/SeriousSam.rc           | 2 +-
 SamTSE/Sources/DedicatedServer/DedicatedServer.rc | 2 +-
 SamTSE/Sources/SeriousSam/SeriousSam.rc           | 2 +-
 4 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/SamTFE/Sources/DedicatedServer/DedicatedServer.rc b/SamTFE/Sources/DedicatedServer/DedicatedServer.rc
index 7117aaf33fe2f64670e38b544194996e11528e3a..94a42ea67def0f0d5832224972576fd028fc0105 100644
--- a/SamTFE/Sources/DedicatedServer/DedicatedServer.rc
+++ b/SamTFE/Sources/DedicatedServer/DedicatedServer.rc
@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@
 //
 // Generated from the TEXTINCLUDE 2 resource.
 //
-#include "afxres.h"
+#include <winres.h>
 
 /////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
 #undef APSTUDIO_READONLY_SYMBOLS
diff --git a/SamTFE/Sources/SeriousSam/SeriousSam.rc b/SamTFE/Sources/SeriousSam/SeriousSam.rc
index 7f2af501b35e4f852216599b20a00827fdf88277..7fbec8914dd0824f59478c64536ea2065f30ae88 100644
--- a/SamTFE/Sources/SeriousSam/SeriousSam.rc
+++ b/SamTFE/Sources/SeriousSam/SeriousSam.rc
